  "project_description": "One Click Accessibility lets your site visitors adjust text, contrast, background, and other readability features from an Accessibility Tools frame added to your site. \n\n Features \n Accessibility Tools have a:\n\n * Increase/Decrease Text size\n\n * Grayscale\n\n * High Contrast\n\n * Negative Contrast\n\n * Light Background\n\n * Links Underline\n\n * Readable Font\n\n Install The Module Then Set Block, you Can configure position Left/Right",
